    "title": "Reminder, comment period ends soon on Snake River temperature plan - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Garrett Christensen ,\n7 hours ago EASTERN OREGON – A reminder to Eastern Oregon residents, the public comment period for the Oregon Department of Environmental Quality’s new Snake River Total Maximum Daily Load (TMDL) and Water Quality Management Plan is closing soon. The final deadline is 4:00 p.m. on Thursday, October 29. For those... Read full article\n1",
